Text Adventures (apps/text)

The interpreter
  zmachine.js is frunk.store's own Z-machine, written after The Z-Machine
  Standards Document 1.1 (Graham Nelson, Andrew Plotkin and others). It
  plays story files of versions 1 to 5, 7 and 8. It was checked against
  CZECH 0.8 (Amir Karger), Praxix and TerpEtude (Andrew Plotkin), and
  against Frotz (2.56 pre-release) on the Zork games; those tests aren't part of this
  repository.

